<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill starts soft-line retailers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill starts soft-line retailers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of soft-line retailers.</p>
<p>-- started Nine West Group as near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Gap Inc was started as near- and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Intimate Brands Inc was started as near-term neutral, long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Limited Inc was initiated as near-term neutral, long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Talbots Inc was started as near-term neutral and long-term buy.</p>
</text>
